bbb: forget cached memory values on every store that may overlap them.

track_var::invalidate_mem kept a register's cached MEM when the store had
another mode or attributes, or lay within 3 bytes (inverted offset test).
A DImode store over an SImode spill slot kept the stale value and
opt_elim_dead_assign deleted the reload (wrong 64-bit products, -O2 -m68080).

